{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/028",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u07479",
   "en": "All right. Maybe it would be better if the Alliance had more pull on the Council. In some ways.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07480",
   "en": "You're damned persuasive, Shepard. You should have Ambassador Udina's job.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07481",
   "en": "I hear that. You're something else, you know that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07482",
   "en": "I don't think we'll be operating without support for much longer. Pretty soon, not even the Council will be able to ignore what's going on.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07483",
   "en": "Glad you'll be here when it's over, Shepard. I'm, uh... I'm looking forward to some shore leave.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07484",
   "en": "You looked like you were about ready to go off on the Council. Much as they deserve it, it's good to take a step back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07485",
   "en": "What am I saying? When don't you? That's what I-- appreciate about you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07486",
   "en": "And this is what will never happen again. Us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07487",
   "en": "Hi, Commander. We're about in the thick of it. I-- I guess I just wanted to say-- Well, it doesn't matter now, I guess.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07488",
   "en": "It's been an honor serving under you, ma'am. I hope we get a chance to shoot the breeze when this is all over.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07489",
   "en": "It's nothing, ma'am. Water under the bridge.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07490",
   "en": "We haven't had a lot of downtime. Soon, maybe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07491",
   "en": "Anything you need, Commander?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07492",
   "en": "Is there some reason we couldn't learn it on our own?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07493",
   "en": "I'm sure Conatix did what they thought was best.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07494",
   "en": "You seemed decisive then, Lieutenant. Why so hesitant now?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07495",
   "en": "Something to add, Lieutenant, or are you just breaking in your thesaurus?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07496",
   "en": "It's up to the Alliance to take its proper place. Even if we have to kick its ass to convince it to kick theirs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07497",
   "en": "You sound like you want the aliens dictating to us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07498",
   "en": "So can I guess this will add to your resentment against aliens?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07499",
   "en": "Don't tell me you and Vyrnnus hugged on graduation day.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07500",
   "en": "I'd think you'd carry a grudge over the crap you took from Vyrnnus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07501",
   "en": "He's probably got something over you in the regrets department.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07502",
   "en": "You were just a kid. How'd you deal with that mess?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07503",
   "en": "You can't deny the turians are imperialists. And the asari, the salarians -- they're manipulators.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07504",
   "en": "When anyone out here listens to us, the Council starts up with their treaties and heel-dragging. We can only rely on ourselves.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07505",
   "en": "I don't need you kissing the Council's asses too.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07506",
   "en": "I can't believe you'd side with aliens over your own kind. I think we're done here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07507",
   "en": "I'm sorry. I'm just angry about the whole mess. You've been invaluable. For everything.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07508",
   "en": "The Council isn't Vyrnnus. The Council is you. Gun-shy after past wars. Too worried about what might happen to take action.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07509",
   "en": "They can't make the hard calls. They're too afraid of what might happen. You had more spine as a kid than they're showing now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07510",
   "en": "They're burying their heads in the sand while Saren rolls over the Terminus Systems. If they won't help themselves, we have a responsibility to save them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07511",
   "en": "No way you're getting me behind a desk.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07512",
   "en": "And here I was concerned you were damaged goods.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07513",
   "en": "Careful. When this is over, I might pay more attention to what you say.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07514",
   "en": "Galaxy in the balance and you trip talking to me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07515",
   "en": "You have something you want to say?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07516",
   "en": "I'd have liked to spend more time getting to know my officers, Alenko.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07517",
   "en": "Why couldn't we do it alone?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07518",
   "en": "You do what you have to.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07519",
   "en": "You mean when we flirted.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07520",
   "en": "Smug aliens. We'll show them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07521",
   "en": "That's your training talking.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07522",
   "en": "Whose side are you on?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07523",
   "en": "What happened with Vyrnnus?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07524",
   "en": "Your experience on Jump Zero.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07525",
   "en": "My money's on Vyrnnus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07526",
   "en": "It must have freaked you out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07527",
   "en": "All turians are the same.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07528",
   "en": "I'm glad you think that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07529",
   "en": "I'm not so sure.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07530",
   "en": "You have it backwards.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07531",
   "en": "True. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07532",
   "en": "I can't respect this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07533",
   "en": "They're afraid.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07534",
   "en": "They're ignoring the problems.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07535",
   "en": "Who'd want it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07536",
   "en": "Couldn't do worse.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07537",
   "en": "Watch yourself, Romeo.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07538",
   "en": "You tease.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07539",
   "en": "What's this about, Lieutenant?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07540",
   "en": "We haven't had time to talk.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07541",
   "en": "Bunch of guys in suits show up at your door after school. Next thing you know, you're out on Jump Zero.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07542",
   "en": "No one \"knows.\" Doesn't mean they didn't happen. As big as the exposures were, it was hard to track down accidentals.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07543",
   "en": "It was different then. No one knew the potential, so there wasn't a lot of regulation. Anything Conatix did was gold.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07544",
   "en": "I'm not saying they intentionally detonated drives over our outposts. But in retrospect, they were damn quick on the scene.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07545",
   "en": "This is almost over. The Council won't be able to deny what we've found after this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07546",
   "en": "Ash backed those salarians to the end. And we still can't get any respect.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07547",
   "en": "We all but served evidence of Saren's intent on a platter. And still we don't get any respect.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07548",
   "en": "If they don't want to do anything, they should get the hell out of our way. It could only improve things if the Alliance was in charge.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07549",
   "en": "It's a damn good one. And we're closer than ever, thanks to you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07550",
   "en": "What? That isn't what you've been pushing?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07551",
   "en": "Didn't you make an argument for pushing the Council out? That the Alliance should demand its due instead of waiting to be accepted?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07552",
   "en": "You're always on top of things.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07553",
   "en": "That's not what I got out of it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07554",
   "en": "Did I misread you? Geez, what else have I got wrong?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07555",
   "en": "All right. I don't want to get you wrong. I've got a lot tied up in this mission.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07556",
   "en": "I've got a lot tied up in you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07557",
   "en": "Shepard, I was gearing up to confront the Council. As an officer, you should keep me in the loop.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07558",
   "en": "As a friend, I'd hope I wouldn't have to remind you of that. Maybe-- maybe I got the message wrong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07559",
   "en": "It sure feels like it. I'm sorry, I need to take a step back and have a look at this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07560",
   "en": "Maybe I do, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07561",
   "en": "I should return to my duties anyway. Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07562",
   "en": "We're so close now. When we deliver everything, the Council will have to mobilize around us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07563",
   "en": "It would be a fitting tribute to Ash if we were able to rally everyone together under the Council.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07564",
   "en": "If we could get the Council on our side, this could become a great opportunity for the Alliance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07565",
   "en": "And you've been at the forefront, all the way from Akuze. I don't think anyone can stop you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07566",
   "en": "And you've been at the forefront, even back in the Blitz. You'll probably get another Star of Terra out of this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07567",
   "en": "And you've been at the forefront the whole way. I can see how you made it through Torfan.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07568",
   "en": "From a Navy brat to lynchpin of the Alliance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07569",
   "en": "Must be the same quality that kept you going after the raid on your colony.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07570",
   "en": "I can see how you hauled yourself out of the gutters on Earth.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07571",
   "en": "I don't think I've ever met a woman like you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07572",
   "en": "I kind of hoped any shore leave would be joint.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07573",
   "en": "Well, ever since I heard the captain's mess gets better food...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07574",
   "en": "No bull, Shepard. I wanna follow through with this. It's tough keeping it separated from duty. But when the mission's complete, it'll be different.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07575",
   "en": "At least, I hope so. Ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07576",
   "en": "Glad to hear it, ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07577",
   "en": "I hope you feel the same. Ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07578",
   "en": "It'll take care of itself one of these days. Or nights.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07579",
   "en": "Shepard, you are hard to step away from.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07580",
   "en": "We'll get this done, Commander. The sooner the better.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07581",
   "en": "Oh, you are good at that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07582",
   "en": "You know of any intentional exposures for certain?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07583",
   "en": "That's the idea, Lieutenant.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07584",
   "en": "That's throwing out the baby with the bathwater, don't you think?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07585",
   "en": "That's the goal, Lieutenant. Just wait until we're closer to doing it before you start crowing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07586",
   "en": "Ease it back, Kaidan. I'm not talking revolution, just getting our due.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07587",
   "en": "Sounds like I crossed some wires. I was probably angry after a rough day. I'm sorry. Let's take a step back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07588",
   "en": "That's why I wear the stars. If I change my mind, all you have to do is keep up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07589",
   "en": "Come on, Kaidan, it's no big deal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07590",
   "en": "If you're having trouble with this, maybe you need to take a step back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07591",
   "en": "It's been a struggle. But we've earned their respect now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07592",
   "en": "There's a lot of work left. There's always more.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07593",
   "en": "Keep that in mind after this is over. I will be tracking your shore leave, mister.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07594",
   "en": "I bet you say that to all your Commanding Officers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07595",
   "en": "I hear you, soldier. I'm in agreement.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07596",
   "en": "That sounds wonderful, Lieutenant. In the meantime, we save the galaxy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07597",
   "en": "That sounds nice. Careful, you'll distract me from saving the galaxy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07598",
   "en": "I hear you, soldier. I'm waiting with bated breath.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07599",
   "en": "He's right, Chief.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07600",
   "en": "Intentional exposures.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07601",
   "en": "You said it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07602",
   "en": "That's a bit harsh.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07603",
   "en": "Yes, just keep it quiet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07604",
   "en": "No, nothing that drastic.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07605",
   "en": "I'm sorry if I misled you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07606",
   "en": "Doesn't matter. I'm in charge.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07607",
   "en": "It's just a misunderstanding.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07608",
   "en": "I guess you did.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07609",
   "en": "About time, huh?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07610",
   "en": "We're not done yet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07611",
   "en": "Don't forget it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07612",
   "en": "An old line, Lieutenant.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07613",
   "en": "Absolutely.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07614",
   "en": "Can't wait.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07615",
   "en": "You won't have to worry about me, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07616",
   "en": "But that's my own baggage, Commander. No bearing on this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07617",
   "en": "If you say so, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07618",
   "en": "Besides, I've got my past squared away.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07619",
   "en": "I hear ya. I--It just seems like a group that's been around as long as the Council should see this coming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
